{"id": "unknown-2026-09-08-015", "date": "2026-09-08", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 37, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Jordan issues first 200 renewables approvals under new grid-connection rules", "content": "<p>Jordan’s energy regulator has approved the first 200 renewable energy systems under the country’s amended Renewable Energy and Energy Efficiency Law. The approvals cover residential and other eligible applicants, as authorities begin processing pending grid-connection requests nationwide.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/09/08/jordan-issues-first-200-renewables-approvals-under-new-grid-connection-rules/\">Jordan issues first 200 renewables approvals under new grid-conn", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/09/08/jordan-issues-first-200-renewables-approvals-under-new-grid-connection-rules/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-09-08-016", "date": "2026-09-08", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 37, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.67, "keywords": ["outperform", "increase", "improve"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Optimized semi-transparent PV greenhouse design increases energy output by 20.1%", "content": "An international research team has developed an optimized semi-transparent PV greenhouse design that increases solar electricity generation by strategically allocating PV surfaces to south-facing roofs and walls. Using an improved optimization algorithm, the design increased annual energy output by 20.1% and outperformed conventional greenhouse geometries by up to 56.86%.", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine_usa", "url": "https://pv-magazine-usa.com/2026/09/08/optimized-semi-transparent-pv-greenhouse-design-increases-energy-output-by-20-1/", "type": "rss"}]}
